'''Malevolent Mohawk Cat''' is an [[:Category:Aku Enemies|Aku]] enemy that appears in [[Century's End (Merciless)|The Malevolent Cat]]. It was added in [[Version 12.7 Update|Version 12.7]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Malevolent Mohawk Cat
|image = E 660.png
|first appearance = [[Century's End (Merciless)|The Malevolent Cat]]
|money drop = 2,000¢ - 7,900¢
}}

==Enemy==
This powerful bruiser has above average range for a melee pusher and advances very quickly with its high health, extreme DPS and a weak but constantly regenerating shield, though its high knockback count does make it a bit easier to hold back if enough damage is accumulated. Surprisingly, it is also Immune to Freeze, Slow, Weaken and Knockback, so not even status effects will meaningfully hinder its advance in absence of brute force. It can duplicate any surges hitting it, but it's already a huge threat without.

==Strategy==
Its weak shield will constantly be regenerated with or without a Shield piercer, so it is up to you whether you want to constantly pierce or just brute force Malevolent Mohawk Cat, as it will be knocked back easily enough due to its high knockback count.

